This license covers the source code only.

The contents of `public/` are NOT covered by it:

  - Satoshi (`public/Satoshi-*.otf`) is licensed under the Indian Type
    Foundry Free Font Licence via Fontshare — free for personal and
    commercial use.

  - Geist (`public/Geist-Regular.ttf`) is licensed under the SIL Open Font
    Licence 1.1. Copyright 2024 The Geist Project Authors.
    https://github.com/vercel/geist-font

  - 庞门正道细线体 / PangMenZhengDao-XiXian
    (`public/fonts/PangMenZhengDao-XiXianTi.ttf`) is free for commercial use
    by its author's terms. 7834 glyphs, 6763 of them CJK.

  - The Night Watch (`public/fonts/TheNightWatch.ttf`) ships with its own
    font pack; see that pack for its terms. 81 glyphs, no CJK coverage.

  - The arrow icon (`public/arrow-top-right-svgrepo-com.svg`) is from
    https://www.svgrepo.com/.

  - Tarot deck art (`public/tarot/*.webp`, 79 files) — **provenance and
    licence unrecorded.**

    These files arrived when this fork turned the carousel into a tarot
    reader. Code comments describe the deck as "Rider–Waite–Smith style",
    which names a layout convention rather than a licence, and the artwork
    is a stylised modern deck rather than the historical RWS plates.

    No licence over these images is granted by the terms above and they must
    not be treated as reusable. **Before redistributing, deploying
    commercially, or forking this repository, the maintainer needs to record
    where these 79 files came from and under what terms they may be
    redistributed** — and replace them if there is no such answer. See the
    Status section of README.md.

Third-party code included in this repository:

  - Simplex noise in `components/shaders/planeShaders.js`
    Copyright (c) 2011 Ashima Arts, (c) 2011-2016 Stefan Gustavson
    MIT License — https://github.com/ashima/webgl-noise
